  "title": "Irresistible Irish Soda Bread",
  "description": "This traditional Irish soda bread recipe uses buttermilk and baking soda to make a moist and delicious soda bread for a tasty St Patrick's day treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Karin Christian"
  ],
